      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-02-13T11:48:32.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.036 (vs ₹0.12 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.036 (down from ₹0.12 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹18.4m (down 49% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹211.1k (down 61% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.2% (down from 1.5% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 86% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 11% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
